OL,3,GNEWSASouth West Water given lowest
OL,4,Aenvironmental rating
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water has been given the
OL,7,Flowest possible environmental rating by
OL,8,Fthe Environment Agency over high levels
OL,9,Fof pollution.
OL,11,FThe regulator downgraded the firm from
OL,12,Ftwo stars out of a possible four to
OL,13,Fone, meaning it is now considered a
OL,14,F"poor performing company" for its
OL,15,Fenvironmental impact.
OL,17,FIt said it had performed "significantly
OL,18,Fbelow target" for sewage pollution
OL,19,Fincidents for the 15th year in a row.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
