OL,3,GNEWSASouth West Water given lowest
OL,4,Aenvironmental rating
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water, which has 1.8 million
OL,7,Fcustomers across Devon, Cornwall, the
OL,8,FIsles of Scilly and parts of Dorset and
OL,9,FSomerset, said it knew there was "much
OL,10,Fmore to do" and was taking action to
OL,11,Fimprove areas that "matter most" to
OL,12,Fcustomers and the environment.
